cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "UDBench"
abstract: >-
  Semi-synthetic benchmark suite for evaluating uncertainty decomposition
  against oracle epistemic and aleatoric targets, accompanying the paper
  "A Unified Risk View of Uncertainty: Posterior Risk for Disentanglement
  and Evaluation Beyond Proxies".
type: software
license: MIT
